<title>PORTUGAL: Lisbon bourse halts Lisnave share trade.</title>
<headline>Lisbon bourse halts Lisnave share trade.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Lisbon bourse said in a statement on Wednesday that it had suspended share trade in ship repairer Lisnave.</p>
<p>It gave no reason for the move.</p>
</text>
